OL,3,GNEWSASteel Queens forge ice hockey
OL,4,Ahistory and inspire new generation
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Caledonia Steel Queens play
OL,7,FGuildford Lightning at Murrayfield Ice
OL,8,FArena later, Scottish ice hockey
OL,9,Fhistory will be made.
OL,11,FThe season opener marks the return of
OL,12,Fthe UK's elite women's league to the
OL,13,Fcountry after 32 years.
OL,15,FIt's a momentous day for the Steel
OL,16,FQueens, who have gone from just seven
OL,17,Fplayers in 2017 to becoming the only
OL,18,Felite team this side of the border,
OL,19,Fwith more than 120 members.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
