OL,3,GNEWSASteel Queens forge ice hockey
OL,4,Ahistory and inspire new generation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club has described the occasion as
OL,7,F"the biggest story in UK ice hockey
OL,8,Fthis year", and hopes it will make the
OL,9,Fsport more accessible for players who
OL,10,Foften have to travel hundreds of miles
OL,11,Fto England to play at the top level.
